tasks.brief:
Implementation constraints: Edit src/static/style.css. Add CSS rules for .thread-search and .thread-search:focus using ONLY existing theme variables. No other edits to this file. No async, no external libraries, no JavaScript.

Behavioral specification: Add the following CSS rules exactly:
.thread-search {
  display: block;
  width: calc(100% - 1.5rem);
  margin: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
  padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
  background: var(--input-bg);
  color: var(--input-text);
  border: 1px solid var(--input-border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
}

.thread-search:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--accent);
}

Acceptance condition: src/static/style.css contains the .thread-search and .thread-search:focus rules with the exact properties listed above.
